{"seq":3,"slug":"forms","title":"表单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/angular-in-depth/engineering/forms","wordCount":1152,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"表单\">表单</h1><p>表单是前端最复杂的一类数据流：值要双向同步、要按规则校验、要展示错误、要处理异步校验（如「用户名是否已被占用」）、要在嵌套结构里收集、还要在提交时统一序列化。Angular 历来提供两套方案——模板驱动与响应式表单，而 Angular 22 把第三套 Signal Forms 转正，把表单纳入了信号响应图。本篇讲清三者各自的定位、校验如何组织、以及 Signals 时代表单该往哪走。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三套表单方案的根本差异在「表单状态住在哪里」：模板驱动让状态隐式地住在模板的指令里、响应式表单让状态显式地住在组件类的 <code>FormGroup</code> 对象里、Signal Forms 让状态住在信号里并参与统一响应图。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[选择表单方案] --&gt; B[模板驱动&lt;br/&gt;状态在模板指令 ngModel]&#10;  A --&gt; C[响应式表单&lt;br/&gt;状态在类的 FormGroup]&#10;  A --&gt; D[Signal Forms&lt;br/&gt;状态在 model 信号]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[简单 少校验 快速原型]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[企业级 复杂校验 可测试]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[信号优先 类型完整 共校验图]\">flowchart TD\n  A[选择表单方案] --&gt; B[模板驱动&lt;br/&gt;状态在模板指令 ngModel]\n  A --&gt; C[响应式表单&lt;br/&gt;状态在类的 FormGroup]\n  A --&gt; D[Signal Forms&lt;br/&gt;状态在 model 信号]\n  B --&gt; B1[简单 少校验 快速原型]\n  C --&gt; C1[企业级 复杂校验 可测试]\n  D --&gt; D1[信号优先 类型完整 共校验图]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>模板驱动</th>\n<th>响应式表单</th>\n<th>Signal Forms（v22 稳定）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态位置</td>\n<td>模板（隐式）</td>\n<td>组件类（显式）</td>\n<td>信号（显式）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>校验声明</td>\n<td>模板指令</td>\n<td>类中的验证器</td>\n<td>与字段共置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>较强（typed forms）</td>\n<td>完整，model 到模板全程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样板量</td>\n<td>少</td>\n<td>多</td>\n<td>少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用</td>\n<td>简单表单</td>\n<td>现有企业级主力</td>\n<td>新表单、新项目首选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模板驱动表单\">模板驱动表单</h2><p>模板驱动表单用 <code>[(ngModel)]</code> 把输入控件双向绑定到组件属性，校验靠模板上的指令（<code>required</code>、<code>minlength</code> 等原生属性加 Angular 指令）。它的状态由 <code>NgForm</code> 和 <code>NgModel</code> 指令隐式管理，你几乎不碰表单对象本身。优点是写得快、心智简单，适合登录框、搜索框这类几个字段的简单表单；缺点是逻辑散在模板里、难以单元测试、复杂校验和动态字段处理起来别扭。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;form #f=&quot;ngForm&quot; (ngSubmit)=&quot;submit(f.value)&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;input name=&quot;email&quot; [(ngModel)]=&quot;email&quot; required email /&gt;&#10;  @if (f.controls[&#39;email&#39;]?.invalid &amp;&amp; f.controls[&#39;email&#39;]?.touched) {&#10;  &lt;small&gt;请输入有效邮箱&lt;/small&gt;&#10;  }&#10;  &lt;button [disabled]=&quot;f.invalid&quot;&gt;提交&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&lt;/form&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">form</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> #f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ngForm\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> (ngSubmit)</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"submit(f.value)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> [(ngModel)]</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> required</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  @if (f.controls['email']?.invalid &#x26;&#x26; f.controls['email']?.touched) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">small</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>请输入有效邮箱&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">small</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> [disabled]</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"f.invalid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>提交&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">form</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>[(ngModel)]</code> 的双向绑定语法在 <a href=\"../foundations/templates-binding\">模板与数据绑定</a> 已介绍过，模板驱动表单本质就是它加一组校验指令的组合。需要导入 <code>FormsModule</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"响应式表单\">响应式表单</h2><p>响应式表单把表单结构显式建在组件类里：<code>FormControl</code> 是单个字段、<code>FormGroup</code> 是字段集合、<code>FormArray</code> 是动态列表。值变化和状态变化都以 Observable 暴露（<code>valueChanges</code>、<code>statusChanges</code>），天然接入第二章 <a href=\"../reactivity/rxjs-observables\">RxJS 与可观察对象</a> 的操作符体系——这是它在企业级应用长期占主导的原因：复杂联动、防抖校验、跨字段规则都能用 RxJS 优雅表达。Angular 14 起的 typed forms 还让 <code>FormGroup</code> 带上了类型，取值不再是 <code>any</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export class SignupComponent {&#10;  private fb = inject(FormBuilder);&#10;&#10;  form = this.fb.group({&#10;    email: [&#39;&#39;, [Validators.required, Validators.email]],&#10;    password: [&#39;&#39;, [Validators.required, Validators.minLength(8)]],&#10;    profile: this.fb.group({&#10;      nickname: [&#39;&#39;],&#10;    }),&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  constructor() {&#10;    // 值变化是 Observable，可接 RxJS 管道&#10;    this.form.controls.email.valueChanges&#10;      .pipe(debounceTime(400), takeUntilDestroyed())&#10;      .subscribe((v) =&gt; this.checkEmailAvailable(v));&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  submit() {&#10;    if (this.form.valid) this.api.signup(this.form.getRawValue());&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SignupComponent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> fb</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(FormBuilder);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  form</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    email: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [Validators.required, Validators.email]],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    password: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [Validators.required, Validators.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">minLength</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)]],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    profile: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      nickname: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 值变化是 Observable，可接 RxJS 管道</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.form.controls.email.valueChanges</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">debounceTime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">takeUntilDestroyed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">subscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">checkEmailAvailable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  submit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.form.valid) </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.api.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">signup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.form.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getRawValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>校验器是返回 <code>null</code>（通过）或错误对象（失败）的函数，分同步与异步两种。异步校验器返回 Observable 或 Promise，适合「问后端这个值行不行」。响应式表单的校验集中在类里、可独立单元测试，这是它相比模板驱动的关键工程优势。需要导入 <code>ReactiveFormsModule</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"signal-forms-信号时代的表单\">Signal Forms：信号时代的表单</h2><p>Signal Forms 在 Angular 22 稳定，是表单自响应式表单以来最大的变化。它的出发点是：既然组件状态、派生、视图都已经用信号统一了，表单为什么还要自成一套（<code>FormGroup</code>/<code>FormControl</code>/<code>valueChanges</code>）的并行体系？Signal Forms 让表单数据就是一个 <code>model</code> 信号，校验与字段共置，类型从数据模型到模板全程贯通，并彻底取消了 <code>ControlValueAccessor</code> 这一历史包袱。它没有 <code>FormGroup</code>/<code>FormControl</code>/<code>FormArray</code> 的概念，但「typed forms 终于是真正类型化的」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export class ProfileComponent {&#10;  // 表单数据就是一个信号&#10;  model = signal({ name: &#39;&#39;, age: 0 });&#10;&#10;  // 用 form() 基于信号建表单，校验与字段共置&#10;  profileForm = form(this.model, (path) =&gt; {&#10;    required(path.name, { message: &#39;姓名必填&#39; });&#10;    min(path.age, 18, { message: &#39;需年满 18 岁&#39; });&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProfileComponent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 表单数据就是一个信号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> signal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, age: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 用 form() 基于信号建表单，校验与字段共置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  profileForm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> form</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(path.name, { message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'姓名必填'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(path.age, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'需年满 18 岁'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;input [formField]=&quot;profileForm.name&quot; /&gt;&#10;@if (profileForm.name().errors().length) {&#10;&lt;small&gt;{{ profileForm.name().errors()[0].message }}&lt;/small&gt;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> [formField]</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"profileForm.name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@if (profileForm.name().errors().length) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">small</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{{ profileForm.name().errors()[0].message }}&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">small</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>因为表单值是信号，它天然融入第二章讲的整张响应图：<code>computed</code> 能直接派生表单状态、<code>effect</code> 能响应表单变化、变更检测在 <a href=\"../reactivity/change-detection\">Zoneless</a> 下精确刷新受影响的字段。迁移策略上，Angular 提供 <code>compatForm()</code> 在同一应用里混用 Signal Forms 与响应式表单，便于渐进采用。实务建议（综合 2026 年社区共识）：新项目、新表单首选 Signal Forms；存量的、关键的大型企业表单可继续用响应式表单，待 v22 生态进一步成熟再逐步迁移——这与 <a href=\"../reactivity/signals\">Signals 响应式</a> 倡导的「信号优先、渐进迁移」基调一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三套表单方案的根本差异是状态住在哪：模板驱动在模板指令、响应式在类的 <code>FormGroup</code>、Signal Forms 在 <code>model</code> 信号。</li>\n<li>模板驱动用 <code>[(ngModel)]</code> 加校验指令，简单快但难测试，适合几个字段的简单表单。</li>\n<li>响应式表单显式建模、校验集中可测、值变化是 Observable 可接 RxJS，是企业级长期主力；typed forms 提供类型。</li>\n<li>Signal Forms（v22 稳定）让表单成为信号、校验与字段共置、类型全程贯通、取消 <code>ControlValueAccessor</code>，融入统一响应图。</li>\n<li>迁移用 <code>compatForm()</code> 混用；新项目首选 Signal Forms，存量关键大表单可暂留响应式表单逐步迁移。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"表单","id":"表单"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模板驱动表单","id":"模板驱动表单"},{"level":2,"text":"响应式表单","id":"响应式表单"},{"level":2,"text":"Signal Forms：信号时代的表单","id":"signal-forms-信号时代的表单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"路由与懒加载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/angular-in-depth/engineering/routing"},"next":{"title":"状态管理：NgRx","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/angular-in-depth/advanced/state-management-ngrx"}}